        "text_FhcE43": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Grandma Rosa would have been so happy and welcomed you with Open arms into our family. We are thrilled to have you as family. As a member, you are now able to experience the off the grid, against the status quo, outside the box experience and exceptional wines, lively winery events and many special offerings. Our Wine Club shipments are processed in February, May, August, and November. Your club is fully customizable and you can choose from any available wines through your online profile. If you prefer to call or email, we are available to make sure the wine in your shipment is exactly what you want.</p><p>Before the shipment is scheduled to be processed, you will receive an email outlining the wines that will be included, the cost, and shipment date. That’s the time to add bottles or to customize your shipment! You can add as many bottles as you like while taking advantage of our flat rate shipping as part of your Wine Club Membership.</p><p>As a member, you and up to two guests are welcome to a choice of multiple complimentary wine tasting flight options and experiences when you visit our Open Containers. Reservations are recommended.<br/>We look forward to seeing you soon and please let us know if you have any questions.</p>",
